      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "100x this. Currently it's only possible to switch to SDK2's locomotion from the default, requiring you to rejoin an instance in order to revert the change. Exposing a way to disable legacy locomotion would allow creators to create toggles *in-game* for users to decide which they prefer, as well as open up creative new options for parkour maps and other mobility games.",
